<title>HONG KONG: Wheelock put more luxury homes on sale.</title>
<headline>Wheelock put more luxury homes on sale.</headline>
<dateline>HONG KONG 1996-10-03</dateline>
<text>
<p>Wheelock and Co Ltd Properties said on Thursday it would release for sale 50 percent more of its luxury Forest Hill houses because of good response.</p>
<p>The total number of units on sale would be 48, instead of the original 32, it said.</p>
<p>The duplex houses at Tai Po, ranging from 1,621 to 2,485 square feet, were priced at an average of HK$7.8 million.</p>
<p>-- Hong Kong Newsroom (852) 2843 6441</p>
</text>
